CHAPTER.VERS:
And [Yahweh] said, Call his name Lo-ammi; for you

          {+}
         are not my people, and I will not be your

          {+}
         [God].

Yet the number of the sons of Israel will be as the sand of the sea, which can't be measured nor numbered; and it will come to pass that, in the place where it was said to them, You

          {+}
         are not my people, it will be said to them, [You

          {+}
         are] the sons of the living God.
